1
00:00:00,679 --> 00:00:02,138
<font color="#FFFFFF">Third Training Grounds</font>

2
00:00:25,514 --> 00:00:26,483
<font color="#FFFFFF">Let's go!</font>

3
00:00:34,705 --> 00:00:36,104
<font color="#FFFFFF">Shadow Clone Jutsu.</font>

4
00:00:40,799 --> 00:00:41,838
<font color="#FFFFFF">Not bad.</font>

5
00:00:42,368 --> 00:00:45,534
<font color="#FFFFFF">Nice... Since he's trapped in midair...</font>

6
00:00:45,564 --> 00:00:47,432
<font color="#FFFFFF">he used the Shadow Clone Jutsu
as a means for movement.</font>

7
00:00:50,459 --> 00:00:51,488
<font color="#FFFFFF">Transform!</font>

8
00:01:01,578 --> 00:01:03,147
<font color="#FFFFFF">Okay, that's as far as you go.</font>

9
00:01:04,346 --> 00:01:06,473
<font color="#FFFFFF">He's gotten pretty tall.</font>

10
00:01:12,108 --> 00:01:13,466
<font color="#FFFFFF">And not only that...</font>

11
00:01:18,332 --> 00:01:22,198
<font color="#FFFFFF">His timing for using
the Shadow Clone Jutsu has gotten better.</font>

12
00:01:28,491 --> 00:01:29,590
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oho...</font>

13
00:01:30,150 --> 00:01:30,989
<font color="#FFFFFF">Not bad.</font>

14
00:01:31,019 --> 00:01:31,918
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's incredible.</font>

15
00:01:34,715 --> 00:01:36,583
<font color="#FFFFFF">You've grown, haven't you, Naruto?</font>

16
00:01:37,682 --> 00:01:38,511
<font color="#FFFFFF">However...</font>

17
00:01:38,911 --> 00:01:43,436
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well, it seems you're just
as impatient as ever.</font>

18
00:01:45,005 --> 00:01:47,372
<font color="#FFFFFF">I haven't even said start yet,
have I?</font>

19
00:01:51,968 --> 00:01:56,124
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't be so hasty.
I haven't even said start yet, have I?</font>

20
00:01:57,492 --> 00:01:58,991
<font color="#FFFFFF">Now then, let's begin.</font>

21
00:02:04,955 --> 00:02:07,253
<font color="#FFFFFF">Ready... start!</font>

22
00:03:42,357 --> 00:03:43,856
<font color="#FFFFFF">Now then, let's begin!</font>

23
00:03:49,880 --> 00:03:52,247
<font color="#FFFFFF">Ready... start!</font>

24
00:03:56,573 --> 00:03:57,602
<font color="#FFFFFF">Damn it!</font>

25
00:03:58,241 --> 00:03:59,800
<font color="#FFFFFF">I've been had!</font>

26
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:01,868
<font color="#FFFFFF">Come on, Naruto, you goof!</font>

27
00:04:02,467 --> 00:04:07,232
<font color="#FFFFFF">The Results of Training</font>

28
00:04:21,718 --> 00:04:26,144
<font color="#FFFFFF">Good work...
Do you remember me?</font>

29
00:04:28,441 --> 00:04:30,709
<font color="#FFFFFF">Of course, I do, Lord Sasori.</font>

30
00:04:31,069 --> 00:04:32,667
<font color="#FFFFFF">Of course, he does.</font>

31
00:04:32,707 --> 00:04:35,404
<font color="#FFFFFF">It wouldn't be much of
a Jutsu if he didn't.</font>

32
00:04:38,401 --> 00:04:41,858
<font color="#FFFFFF">They become loyal subordinates
after regaining their memory.</font>

33
00:05:22,187 --> 00:05:23,756
<font color="#FFFFFF">I say it's about ready?</font>

34
00:05:24,715 --> 00:05:26,513
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right, it's done...</font>

35
00:05:30,479 --> 00:05:33,176
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sasori, my good man.
You watch from here...</font>

36
00:05:33,376 --> 00:05:34,205
<font color="#FFFFFF">Okay.</font>

37
00:05:48,791 --> 00:05:50,129
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'll attack the village...</font>

38
00:05:51,858 --> 00:05:53,426
<font color="#FFFFFF">from above.</font>

39
00:05:54,555 --> 00:05:57,952
<font color="#FFFFFF">What do you think of
this artistic form...?</font>

40
00:05:59,550 --> 00:06:03,047
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't make me wait too long, Deidara!</font>

41
00:06:19,160 --> 00:06:24,155
<font color="#FFFFFF">One-Tail, the Jinchuriki of Shukaku,
Gaara of the desert, eh?</font>

42
00:06:25,854 --> 00:06:27,952
<font color="#FFFFFF">Now then, I wonder what he's like.</font>

43
00:06:42,337 --> 00:06:44,805
<font color="#FFFFFF">Now...
What're you going to do, Sakura?</font>

44
00:06:48,531 --> 00:06:52,227
<font color="#FFFFFF">Right? Above? Left?</font>

45
00:06:53,496 --> 00:06:54,325
<font color="#FFFFFF">Behind?</font>

46
00:06:58,391 --> 00:06:59,920
<font color="#FFFFFF">If he's in none of those places...</font>

47
00:07:01,888 --> 00:07:03,216
<font color="#FFFFFF">He must be below.</font>

48
00:07:09,050 --> 00:07:09,750
<font color="#FFFFFF">Huh?</font>

49
00:07:17,372 --> 00:07:20,239
<font color="#FFFFFF">Wh-What ridiculous strength.</font>

50
00:07:20,839 --> 00:07:22,667
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right, well done.</font>

51
00:07:25,494 --> 00:07:26,863
<font color="#FFFFFF">Fifth Hokage...</font>

52
00:07:27,092 --> 00:07:30,689
<font color="#FFFFFF">You didn't just teach Sakura
Medical Ninjutsu, huh?</font>

53
00:07:32,787 --> 00:07:35,154
<font color="#FFFFFF">That short temper and
incredible strength.</font>

54
00:07:35,824 --> 00:07:38,921
<font color="#FFFFFF">She raised a splendid second Tsunade.</font>

55
00:07:39,480 --> 00:07:40,819
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kakashi Sensei.</font>

56
00:07:40,849 --> 00:07:41,648
<font color="#FFFFFF">Huh?</font>

57
00:07:41,948 --> 00:07:43,176
<font color="#FFFFFF">I found you.</font>

58
00:07:49,310 --> 00:07:53,866
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'd... I'd better stop acting like
an idiot in front of Sakura.</font>

59
00:07:54,135 --> 00:07:55,464
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'll get killed...!</font>

60
00:07:57,732 --> 00:08:00,729
<font color="#FFFFFF">She built up her maximum
Chakra inside her body at once</font>

61
00:08:00,759 --> 00:08:03,096
<font color="#FFFFFF">and instantly concentrated
all of it into her fist.</font>

62
00:08:03,726 --> 00:08:07,592
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's a feat that can't be done
without considerable Chakra control.</font>

63
00:08:08,591 --> 00:08:11,118
<font color="#FFFFFF">Medical Ninjutsu along
with superhuman strength...</font>

64
00:08:11,518 --> 00:08:13,716
<font color="#FFFFFF">No. It's more than that.</font>

65
00:08:14,015 --> 00:08:16,683
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sakura's originally a Genjutsu-type,
after all.</font>

66
00:08:17,312 --> 00:08:20,978
<font color="#FFFFFF">She might just become
a better Kunoichi than the Fifth Hokage.</font>

67
00:08:23,176 --> 00:08:26,833
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right, now I guess
it's my turn, huh?</font>

68
00:08:42,057 --> 00:08:42,916
<font color="#FFFFFF">One.</font>

69
00:08:45,814 --> 00:08:46,513
<font color="#FFFFFF">Two.</font>

70
00:08:50,509 --> 00:08:51,308
<font color="#FFFFFF">Three.</font>

71
00:08:52,177 --> 00:08:54,205
<font color="#FFFFFF">So there are three people
guarding the skies...</font>

72
00:08:59,240 --> 00:09:03,696
<font color="#FFFFFF">Still, this village sure has
quite the artistic design to it.</font>

73
00:09:04,495 --> 00:09:07,192
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's certainly worth destroying, though...</font>

74
00:09:13,186 --> 00:09:14,954
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's time for covert action from here on.</font>

75
00:09:52,187 --> 00:09:53,446
<font color="#FFFFFF">There he is.</font>

76
00:09:54,145 --> 00:09:55,584
<font color="#FFFFFF">The basics for a Shinobi are</font>

77
00:09:55,614 --> 00:09:58,840
<font color="#FFFFFF">to eliminate their presence
and remain hidden.</font>

78
00:10:07,402 --> 00:10:09,600
<font color="#FFFFFF">This is totally different from
back then.</font>

79
00:10:11,528 --> 00:10:12,697
<font color="#FFFFFF">The basics for a Shinobi</font>

80
00:10:12,727 --> 00:10:15,324
<font color="#FFFFFF">are to eliminate their presence
and remain hidden.</font>

81
00:10:23,855 --> 00:10:26,483
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right, everyone seems
to be well hidden...</font>

82
00:10:29,510 --> 00:10:33,146
<font color="#FFFFFF">Now, fight me fair and square!</font>

83
00:10:33,546 --> 00:10:36,543
<font color="#FFFFFF">Say, aren't you just a little bit off there?</font>

84
00:10:54,425 --> 00:10:56,483
<font color="#FFFFFF">Let me teach the two of you something.</font>

85
00:10:57,182 --> 00:11:00,818
<font color="#FFFFFF">Shinobi Battle Skills, part one... Taijutsu.</font>

86
00:11:08,271 --> 00:11:09,440
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're wide open!</font>

87
00:11:13,336 --> 00:11:14,635
<font color="#FFFFFF">If I can hit him once...</font>

88
00:11:16,962 --> 00:11:19,660
<font color="#FFFFFF">It won't mean a thing
if you don't hit me.</font>

89
00:11:24,854 --> 00:11:27,192
<font color="#FFFFFF">Phew, that was a close one.</font>

90
00:11:27,891 --> 00:11:29,390
<font color="#FFFFFF">Shadow Clone Jutsu.</font>

91
00:11:31,118 --> 00:11:32,117
<font color="#FFFFFF">Here I come!</font>

92
00:11:33,186 --> 00:11:34,784
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right, bring it on.</font>

93
00:11:39,380 --> 00:11:40,709
<font color="#FFFFFF">The bell's mine.</font>

94
00:11:45,773 --> 00:11:46,972
<font color="#FFFFFF">You won't get away!</font>

95
00:11:50,199 --> 00:11:51,328
<font color="#FFFFFF">Dancing Leaf Shadow...?</font>

96
00:12:00,319 --> 00:12:02,387
<font color="#FFFFFF">This is Bushy Brow's...!</font>

97
00:12:02,457 --> 00:12:04,784
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's Kakashi Sensei's Copy Ninjutsu!</font>

98
00:12:15,274 --> 00:12:18,001
<font color="#FFFFFF">Now... where's the real one?</font>

99
00:12:18,401 --> 00:12:19,899
<font color="#FFFFFF">Right here.</font>

100
00:12:21,668 --> 00:12:23,596
<font color="#FFFFFF">Secret Finger Jutsu.</font>

101
00:12:25,793 --> 00:12:27,632
<font color="#FFFFFF">A Thousand Years of Death!</font>

102
00:12:32,726 --> 00:12:35,454
<font color="#FFFFFF">Now... where's the real one?</font>

103
00:12:35,823 --> 00:12:37,282
<font color="#FFFFFF">Right here!</font>

104
00:12:39,050 --> 00:12:40,978
<font color="#FFFFFF">Secret Finger Jutsu!</font>

105
00:12:43,516 --> 00:12:45,544
<font color="#FFFFFF">A Thousand Years of Death!</font>

106
00:12:51,368 --> 00:12:53,665
<font color="#FFFFFF">Damn it. I missed!</font>

107
00:12:55,863 --> 00:12:59,230
<font color="#FFFFFF">That was a close one...
In a different sense.</font>

108
00:13:14,585 --> 00:13:16,982
<font color="#FFFFFF">It used to be so easy.</font>

109
00:13:17,412 --> 00:13:19,280
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'll tear you apart!</font>

110
00:13:20,079 --> 00:13:22,437
<font color="#FFFFFF">Damn it! You can't dodge this!</font>

111
00:13:23,705 --> 00:13:25,104
<font color="#FFFFFF">Geez, man!</font>

112
00:13:27,132 --> 00:13:28,001
<font color="#FFFFFF">Huh?</font>

113
00:13:28,601 --> 00:13:31,667
<font color="#FFFFFF">Ninja don't let their opponent
get behind them over and over, you idiot!</font>

114
00:13:32,626 --> 00:13:34,964
<font color="#FFFFFF">Leaf Village Secret Finger Jutsu!</font>

115
00:13:38,790 --> 00:13:40,419
<font color="#FFFFFF">A Thousand Years of Death!</font>

116
00:13:41,418 --> 00:13:42,616
<font color="#FFFFFF">She's over there, huh?</font>

117
00:13:45,454 --> 00:13:47,681
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sasuke, where are you?</font>

118
00:13:48,581 --> 00:13:50,309
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't tell me Sensei
already got to you!</font>

119
00:13:51,278 --> 00:13:54,505
<font color="#FFFFFF">No, that'd never happen to him!</font>

120
00:13:57,172 --> 00:13:59,170
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm safe! He hasn't noticed me!</font>

121
00:14:00,139 --> 00:14:01,737
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sakura, behind you.</font>

122
00:14:09,530 --> 00:14:11,727
<font color="#FFFFFF">They've been apart for two years,</font>

123
00:14:11,757 --> 00:14:14,055
<font color="#FFFFFF">and yet his teamwork with Sakura
isn't that bad.</font>

124
00:14:19,879 --> 00:14:21,278
<font color="#FFFFFF">Though I want to...</font>

125
00:14:21,318 --> 00:14:23,416
<font color="#FFFFFF">find out what happens next
in the new volume...</font>

126
00:14:23,775 --> 00:14:26,113
<font color="#FFFFFF">Multi Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

127
00:14:33,935 --> 00:14:37,162
<font color="#FFFFFF">As always, the sheer number
of his clones amazes me...</font>

128
00:14:37,202 --> 00:14:38,301
<font color="#FFFFFF">Let's go!</font>

129
00:14:38,431 --> 00:14:39,460
<font color="#FFFFFF">- Yeah!
- Yeah!</font>

130
00:15:06,273 --> 00:15:09,769
<font color="#FFFFFF">Good grief... It looks like
I won't have time for reading.</font>

131
00:15:12,626 --> 00:15:14,824
<font color="#FFFFFF">Things are getting interesting.</font>

132
00:15:15,364 --> 00:15:17,921
<font color="#FFFFFF">Naruto and Sakura
are pretty good, aren't they?</font>

133
00:15:18,091 --> 00:15:19,989
<font color="#FFFFFF">Things are just getting started.</font>

134
00:15:24,714 --> 00:15:27,052
<font color="#FFFFFF">Now then, what should I do...?</font>

135
00:15:52,856 --> 00:15:54,924
<font color="#FFFFFF">Wh-What's this strange thing?</font>

136
00:15:57,681 --> 00:15:59,579
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's not strange, you know.</font>

137
00:16:03,875 --> 00:16:07,711
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sure enough, fools don't understand
what art is all about...</font>

138
00:16:09,939 --> 00:16:11,507
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'll show you with your own bodies.</font>

139
00:16:11,907 --> 00:16:14,864
<font color="#FFFFFF">True art... is an explosion!</font>

140
00:16:23,356 --> 00:16:27,352
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm sure I heard the sound
of the bells from this way.</font>

141
00:16:28,291 --> 00:16:30,389
<font color="#FFFFFF">There's a possibility that
he rang them on purpose.</font>

142
00:16:30,718 --> 00:16:31,647
<font color="#FFFFFF">Be careful.</font>

143
00:16:31,987 --> 00:16:34,944
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah, it's Kakashi Sensei, after all.</font>

144
00:16:44,974 --> 00:16:46,033
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sasuke!</font>

145
00:16:46,273 --> 00:16:47,431
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sasuke.</font>

146
00:16:48,670 --> 00:16:52,996
<font color="#FFFFFF">Naruto, Sakura... Help me.</font>

147
00:16:54,295 --> 00:16:58,490
<font color="#FFFFFF">I got away from Orochimaru.</font>

148
00:16:59,419 --> 00:17:00,289
<font color="#FFFFFF">Help me.</font>

149
00:17:01,957 --> 00:17:05,613
<font color="#FFFFFF">Naruto, Sakura... Please.</font>

150
00:17:06,113 --> 00:17:11,048
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's too bad... I want to talk with Sasuke
a little while longer, but...</font>

151
00:17:15,104 --> 00:17:16,043
<font color="#FFFFFF">Release!</font>

152
00:17:19,799 --> 00:17:22,167
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm not interested in illusions,
you see.</font>

153
00:17:22,796 --> 00:17:24,335
<font color="#FFFFFF">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

154
00:17:26,792 --> 00:17:29,489
<font color="#FFFFFF">Naruto, Kakashi Sensei's behind
that tree there.</font>

155
00:17:29,589 --> 00:17:30,428
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, no!</font>

156
00:17:30,458 --> 00:17:33,226
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah, I know.</font>

157
00:17:37,481 --> 00:17:39,020
<font color="#FFFFFF">Rasengan!</font>

158
00:17:44,115 --> 00:17:45,473
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kakashi Sensei.</font>

159
00:17:45,743 --> 00:17:46,412
<font color="#FFFFFF">Huh?</font>

160
00:17:47,072 --> 00:17:51,437
<font color="#FFFFFF">You have something to say, don't you?
I missed it before.</font>

161
00:17:53,236 --> 00:17:57,032
<font color="#FFFFFF">Shinobi Battle Skills, part two... Genjutsu.</font>

162
00:18:17,581 --> 00:18:18,440
<font color="#FFFFFF">Huh?</font>

163
00:18:18,910 --> 00:18:20,139
<font color="#FFFFFF">What was that just now?</font>

164
00:18:20,179 --> 00:18:23,735
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey! Where'd Sensei go?
Huh? Huh? What's going on?</font>

165
00:18:24,175 --> 00:18:25,573
<font color="#FFFFFF">What's what?</font>

166
00:18:26,602 --> 00:18:27,531
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sakura.</font>

167
00:18:28,201 --> 00:18:29,329
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, Sasuke!</font>

168
00:18:29,829 --> 00:18:35,064
<font color="#FFFFFF">S-Sakura. H-Help me.</font>

169
00:18:43,315 --> 00:18:47,152
<font color="#FFFFFF">She fell for it so easily back then...</font>

170
00:18:47,711 --> 00:18:50,079
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kakashi Sensei,
talk about a lack of pizzazz.</font>

171
00:18:50,548 --> 00:18:53,146
<font color="#FFFFFF">No way will we fall for the same trick
over and over again.</font>

172
00:18:53,206 --> 00:18:54,604
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's right, that's right.</font>

173
00:18:55,204 --> 00:18:57,771
<font color="#FFFFFF">No, that's not necessarily the case.</font>

174
00:18:59,270 --> 00:19:01,797
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right! He dropped the bells.</font>

175
00:19:02,237 --> 00:19:03,435
<font color="#FFFFFF">Naruto, don't.</font>

176
00:19:03,665 --> 00:19:04,794
<font color="#FFFFFF">They're mine...!</font>

177
00:19:08,760 --> 00:19:10,828
<font color="#FFFFFF">See? Naruto would still fall
for the same trick.</font>

178
00:19:12,686 --> 00:19:13,425
<font color="#FFFFFF">Huh?</font>

179
00:19:13,525 --> 00:19:16,452
<font color="#FFFFFF">No way will I fall for a trap...
like this.</font>

180
00:19:17,721 --> 00:19:18,580
<font color="#FFFFFF">Wha—?</font>

181
00:19:19,220 --> 00:19:20,448
<font color="#FFFFFF">Substitution Jutsu.</font>

182
00:19:20,578 --> 00:19:21,717
<font color="#FFFFFF">Damn it.</font>

183
00:19:22,147 --> 00:19:24,644
<font color="#FFFFFF">You idiot. Didn't I tell you?</font>

184
00:19:26,712 --> 00:19:30,039
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sure enough,
the same tricks won't work, huh?</font>

185
00:19:40,358 --> 00:19:41,697
<font color="#FFFFFF">Infiltration successful.</font>

186
00:19:50,448 --> 00:19:51,547
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's as far as you go.</font>

187
00:21:36,212 --> 00:21:38,780
<font color="#FFFFFF">Can you see the intense smoke
from an explosion?</font>

188
00:21:38,840 --> 00:21:42,306
<font color="#FFFFFF">There's great turbulence in the skies
above the Hidden Sand.</font>

189
00:21:42,436 --> 00:21:43,605
<font color="#FFFFFF">Can you give us any details?</font>

190
00:21:43,635 --> 00:21:46,632
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes. It appears Lord Kazekage
is engaged in a fierce battle in the sky</font>

191
00:21:46,672 --> 00:21:48,200
<font color="#FFFFFF">with an intruder.</font>

192
00:21:48,530 --> 00:21:51,367
<font color="#FFFFFF">All the residents can do is watch... Oh!</font>

193
00:21:51,397 --> 00:21:52,466
<font color="#FFFFFF">Are you all right?</font>

194
00:21:53,465 --> 00:21:54,894
<font color="#FFFFFF">It seems we have lost audio.</font>

195
00:21:55,263 --> 00:21:57,991
<font color="#FFFFFF">We will continue to report the moment
we receive more information.</font>

196
00:21:58,290 --> 00:22:00,588
<font color="#FFFFFF">Next time:
"The Jinchuriki of the Sand"</font>

